# ── Secrets — NEVER commit ────────────────────────────────
# The xAI API key and any Supabase service key live here.
.env
tools/.env
*.env.local

# ── Generated companion clips ─────────────────────────────
# Large video files. These live in Supabase Storage, not in git
# (GitHub Pages would choke on them and the repo would bloat).
companion/generated/

# ── Companion dev scaffolding — local-only, never deploy ───
# The runtime needs only js/companion.js + the poster
# (assets/companion/cat-face-sq.jpg); clips are served from Supabase Storage.
# Everything below is generation tooling, source art, prompt catalogs, and
# local preview pages — no reason to publish it to the public v2 Pages branch.
#
# IMPORTANT: companion/*.json also ignores companion/clips-manifest.json on
# purpose. The manifest points at local companion/generated/ paths that don't
# deploy; keeping it OUT of the deploy means prod fetches it, 404s, and the
# engine falls back to listing the Supabase `companion` bucket (the real source
# in production). The file stays on disk for local dev — git just won't ship it.
companion/*.json
companion/*.csv
companion/*.md
companion/base/
companion/charkles/
assets/companion/*
!assets/companion/cat-face-sq.jpg
companion-mvp.html
companion-app-mock.html
.claude/workflows/

# ── Node ──────────────────────────────────────────────────
node_modules/

# ── OS / editor cruft ─────────────────────────────────────
.DS_Store
Thumbs.db
